</code></pre>
<p>I tried searching online but haven't found any information if this is possible. How can I insert the tags above in the <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> of each page using <code>.htaccess</code>?</p>,"<p>.htaccess filters and modifies http requests, not handle them. To handle a request server side, you should use a server-side language such as php to make changes to html files.</p>

