Javascript dynamically inserted later on: how to make it run?<p>I have scripts In my React app that are inserted dynamically later on. The scripts don't load.</p>
<p>In my database there is a field called <code>content</code>, which contains data that includes html and javascript. There are many records and each record can include multiple scripts in the <code>content</code> field. So it's not really an option to statically specify each of the script-urls in my React app. The field for a record could for example look like:</p>
