                ... some other data
            &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    );
}
</code></pre>
<p>It correctly loads the data from the database and displays the html from that data. However, the Javascript does not get executed. I think the script doesn't work because it is dynamically inserted later on. <strong>How can I make these scripts work/run?</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://stackoverflow.com/a/20584396">This post</a> suggest a solution for dynamically inserted scripts, but I don't think I can apply this solution because in my case the script/code is inserted from a database (so how to then use <code>nodeScriptReplace</code> on the code...?). Any suggestions how I might make my scripts work?</p>
