<p>Is there a way to check if the role can be added to the user by a bot? Thanks in advance.</p>,"<p>Role hiearchy isn't the sole factor in determining if a role is editable. For example, if your bot doesn't have the <code>MANAGE_ROLES</code> permission, then no matter how high your bot's highest role is, <code>Role#editable</code> will still return false.</p>

