</code></pre>
<p>I would like to access the <code>&quot;friends&quot;</code> node. While doing so, I'd also like to store the data in a 2d array. So, each sub-array will contain the data about the user we're currently looping through and one of their friends. This should happen until we've looped through all of the user's friends and then move on to the next user.</p>
