<p>When user attempt to drop said element into drop target element whose class list attributes doesn't contain &quot;chigaco&quot; the drop isn't performed. So far so good.</p>
<p>The issue is that instead the code drops the draggable element into the drop target element with class list attribute containing draggable element id. But what I'd like is for my code to do nothing.</p>
