<p>Well, it works, but the result looks a bit fuzzy. The lines are far from beeing sharp.</p>
<p>So I downloaded the original <a href="https://material.io/resources/icons/?icon=remove_circle_outline&amp;style=baseline" rel="nofollow noreferrer">SVG</a> and added it directly:</p>
<pre class="lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;
