What is the correct way to remove a font from multiple HTML files without manual update?<p>Currently, I am using a font for emails ...let's call is - &quot;FontX&quot;</p>
<p>In all the email  template (html), the &quot;Font X&quot; is being used everywhere. Now that I am looking to cancel the license of the font, I need to make sure font is not being used or referenced anywhere in the email templates.</p>
