<p>I want to find the issue, and get rid of overlapping cards. <a href="https://i.stack.imgur.com/y1zap.png" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><img src="https://i.stack.imgur.com/y1zap.png" alt="The overlapping cards in smaller screen" /></a></p>,"<p>Simply add <code>width: 100%</code> with <code>.thumbcard</code> classes and with <code>@media(max-width:768px){}</code> classes.</p>

