 &lt;th class=&quot;text-center text-dark&quot; name=&quot;name 4&quot;&gt;Title&lt;/th&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>Any thoughts or suggestions are apprecieated!</p>,"<p>You're not going to be able to use <code>aria</code> attributes to override the innerText of a table header element -- at least not reliably and consistently.</p>

