Perfectly aligning one div with another<p>I'm attempting to position a circular pie-shaped progress bar div behind the circular transparency of another div. Since the div I'm aligning with is relative with an absolute positioned child image div, I put the &quot;pie&quot; div as a child element of that relative positioned div, also positioned absolutely, and set padding properties as percentages thinking that would ensure it sized responsively with the sibling/parent divs.</p>
<p><a href="https://i.stack.imgur.com/vWrRs.png" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><img src="https://i.stack.imgur.com/vWrRs.png" alt="enter image description here" /></a></p>
